{"id":"73cb2f85d7abd7df","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-value-glut.md","title":"真值过剩","display":"df-truth-value-glut — 真值过剩","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-value-glut","aliases":["91-df-truth-value-glut","91-df-glut"],"display":"df-truth-value-glut — 真值过剩","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-value-glut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-value-glut</span><span>91-df-glut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-value-glut — 真值过剩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-value-glut-—-真值过剩-$\\mathrm{Glut}$\">df-truth-value-glut — 真值过剩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Glut}\">\\(\\mathrm{Glut}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (扩展语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (双向语义结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash^{+},\\vDash^{-}\\subseteq\n\\{\\mathcal B\\}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\vDash^{+},\\vDash^{-}\\subseteq\n\\{\\mathcal B\\}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>\n(分别表示被肯定与被否定的满足关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}glut}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\mathcal B\\vDash^{+}\\varphi\\land\n\\mathcal B\\vDash^{-}\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}glut}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\mathcal B\\vDash^{+}\\varphi\\land\n\\mathcal B\\vDash^{-}\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>：相对于双向语义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 的真值过剩</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\vDash^+\\varphi,\\mathcal B\\vDash^-\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal B\\vDash^+\\varphi,\\mathcal B\\vDash^-\\varphi\\)</span>：\n分别在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 中肯定与否定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>真值过剩的含义：\n真值过剩是指既真又假的句子集合。这是与真值间隙对立的概念，在某些超一致逻辑中出现。</p>\n<p>真值过剩与间隙的对比：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>真值状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>间隙</td>\n<td>正、负满足均不成立</td>\n<td>既不真也不假</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过剩</td>\n<td>正、负满足均成立</td>\n<td>既真又假</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>真值过剩与悖论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在经典逻辑中，真值过剩导致矛盾</li>\n<li>在超一致逻辑中，真值过剩被系统化接受</li>\n<li>悖论句子可能导致过剩而非间隙</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理理论对过剩的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>对过剩的态度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB/UTB</td>\n<td>通常在经典一致模型中研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>一致的强 Kleene 固定点排除过剩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>经典对象逻辑若一致则排除过剩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超一致理论</td>\n<td>系统化接受过剩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>超一致逻辑与过剩：\n超一致逻辑（paraconsistent logic）允许真值过剩：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>悖论句子既真又假</li>\n<li>爆炸规则（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\neg \\varphi \\vdash \\psi\">\\(\\varphi, \\neg \\varphi \\vdash \\psi\\)</span>）失效</li>\n<li>可以在理论中安全处理悖论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-value-glut-—-真值过剩-$\\mathrm{Glut}$","text":"df-truth-value-glut — 真值过剩 $\\mathrm{Glut}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_T$ (扩展语言, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Glut}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash^{+},\\vDash^{-}\\subseteq\n\\{\\mathcal B\\}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}glut}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\mathcal B\\vDash^{+}\\varphi\\land\n\\mathcal B\\vDash^{-}\\varphi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\vDash^+\\varphi,\\mathcal B\\vDash^-\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi, \\neg \\varphi \\vdash \\psi","display":false}],"bytes":2067,"backl